msgid ""
"Build safe RSS and JSON feeds from WordPress, atshift Fields, and atshift "
"User Profile Fields data."
msgstr ""
"WordPress、atshift Fields、atshift User Profile Fieldsのデータから、安全なRSS"
"フィードとJSONフィードを作成します。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:38
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:39
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-plugin.php:123
msgid "Add New Feed"
msgstr "新規フィードを追加"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:68
msgid "Choose a feed format"
msgstr "フィード形式を選択"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:69
msgid ""
"The selected standard determines the available output fields and validation "
"rules."
msgstr "選択した標準仕様に応じて、使用できる出力項目と検証ルールが決まります。"

#. translators: %s: Feed format name.
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:83
#, php-format
msgid "Create %s feed"
msgstr "%sフィードを作成"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:97
msgid "You are not allowed to create feeds."
msgstr "フィードを作成する権限がありません。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:105
msgid "Invalid feed format."
msgstr "フィード形式が正しくありません。"

#. translators: %s: Feed format name.
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:114
#, php-format
msgid "New %s feed"
msgstr "新規%sフィード"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:121
msgid "The feed could not be created."
msgstr "フィードを作成できませんでした。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:134
msgid "Feed source"
msgstr "フィードソース"

#. translators: %s: Feed format name.
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:139
#, php-format
msgid "%s output mapping"
msgstr "%sの出力マッピング"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:147
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:954
msgid "Feed URL"
msgstr "フィードURL"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:148
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "プレビュー"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:159
msgid "Help"
msgstr "説明"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:167
msgid ""
"The most recent update time in the feed, calculated automatically. Services "
"use it to detect changes."
msgstr ""
"フィード内で最も新しい更新日時を自動計算します。外部サービスが更新を検知する"
"ために使用します。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:168
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:169
msgid ""
"The permanent public URL of this feed. It is generated automatically and "
"tells services which URL is authoritative."
msgstr ""
"このフィードの正式な公開URLです。自動生成され、外部サービスへ正規のURLを伝え"
"ます。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:170
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:171
msgid ""
"The person or organization responsible for operating and publishing the "
"feed, not necessarily the article author."
msgstr ""
"フィードを運営・発行する責任者または組織です。記事作成者と同じである必要はあ"
"りません。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:172
msgid ""
"A feed item is one published post included in the feed. This container is "
"created automatically."
msgstr ""
"フィードでは、配信対象の公開投稿1件ずつを「項目」と呼びます。この入れ物は自動"
"生成されます。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:173
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:174
msgid ""
"Feed readers use this value to recognize the same post after an update and "
"avoid duplicates. It should not change after publication."
msgstr ""
"更新後も同じ投稿だとフィードリーダーが識別し、重複を防ぐための値です。公開後"
"に変わらない値を使用します。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:175
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:176
msgid ""
"The public page readers open for this post. Custom post types also use their "
"normal permalink."
msgstr ""
"読者がこの投稿を開くときの公開ページです。カスタム投稿タイプでも通常のパーマ"
"リンクを使用します。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:177
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:178
msgid "The person credited with writing or creating the post."
msgstr "投稿を執筆または作成した人物として表示する情報です。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:179
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:180
msgid ""
"An optional person who checked or supervised the content. Leave it out when "
"there is no reviewer."
msgstr ""
"内容を確認・監修した人物の任意情報です。監修者がいない場合は出力しません。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:181
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:182
msgid ""
"The original or related source behind the post. Use this when the WordPress "
"post summarizes information published elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"投稿の根拠となる原典や関連情報です。別の場所で公開された情報をWordPress投稿で"
"要約するときなどに使用します。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:183
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:184
msgid ""
"Classification labels attached to the post. They help readers and services "
"group or filter items."
msgstr ""
"投稿に付けられた分類用の名前です。読者や外部サービスが項目を分類・絞り込みす"
"るために使用します。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:185
msgid ""
"The representative image for the item. A fallback can be used when the post "
"has no featured image."
msgstr ""
"項目を代表する画像です。アイキャッチ画像がない場合は代替画像を指定できます。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:221
msgid "Equals"
msgstr "等しい"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:222
msgid "Does not equal"
msgstr "等しくない"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:223
msgid "Contains"
msgstr "含む"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:224
msgid "Exists"
msgstr "存在する"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:225
msgid "Does not exist"
msgstr "存在しない"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:231
msgid "Output format"
msgstr "出力形式"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:233
msgid "The format is fixed for this feed."
msgstr "このフィードの形式は作成後に変更できません。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:237
msgid "Feed slug"
msgstr "フィードスラッグ"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:237
msgid ""
"A short identifier used in the public feed URL. Use lowercase letters, "
"numbers, and hyphens."
msgstr ""
"公開フィードURLの一部になる短い識別名です。半角小文字、数字、ハイフンを使用し"
"ます。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:239
msgid "Changing this value changes the public feed URL."
msgstr "この値を変更すると、公開フィードURLも変わります。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:243
msgid "Content types"
msgstr "コンテンツタイプ"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:243
msgid ""
"Choose which kinds of WordPress content become feed items. Selecting a "
"custom post type includes its published entries."
msgstr ""
"どの種類のWordPressコンテンツを配信項目にするか選びます。カスタム投稿タイプを"
"選ぶと、その公開済み投稿も対象になります。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:247
msgid "WordPress content"
msgstr "WordPress標準コンテンツ"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:248
msgid "Custom post types"
msgstr "カスタム投稿タイプ"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:248
msgid "No public custom post types are currently registered."
msgstr "現在、公開カスタム投稿タイプは登録されていません。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:275
msgid "Feed content filters"
msgstr "配信内容の絞り込み"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:275
msgid ""
"These settings limit which published posts are included in the feed. They do "
"not change the values output for each item."
msgstr ""
"フィードに含める公開投稿を条件で絞り込みます。各項目から出力する値を変更する"
"設定ではありません。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:278
msgid "Active"
msgstr "設定あり"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:284
msgid ""
"Choose which posts are included by author, taxonomy term, or custom field "
"value. Different filter groups must all match; within each taxonomy, any "
"selected term can match."
msgstr ""
"投稿者、カテゴリーなどのターム、カスタムフィールドの値で配信する投稿を絞り込"
"みます。異なる条件グループはすべて一致する必要があり、同じタクソノミー内では"
"選択したいずれかのタームに一致すれば対象になります。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:287
msgid "Authors"
msgstr "投稿者"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:287
msgid "Include posts written by the selected authors."
msgstr "選択した投稿者が作成した投稿だけを配信対象にします。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:299
msgid "Taxonomy terms"
msgstr "タクソノミーのターム"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:299
msgid ""
"Include posts assigned to the selected categories, tags, or custom taxonomy "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"選択したカテゴリー、タグ、カスタムタクソノミーのタームが付いた投稿だけを配信"
"対象にします。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:301
msgid "No public taxonomy terms are currently registered."
msgstr "現在、公開タクソノミーのタームは登録されていません。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:322
msgid "Custom field conditions"
msgstr "カスタムフィールド条件"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:322
msgid "Include posts by matching a public custom field key and value."
msgstr ""
"公開可能なカスタムフィールドのキーと値を条件にして、配信する投稿を絞り込みま"
"す。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:326
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:346
#: includes/adapters/class-atshift-feed-builder-post-meta-adapter.php:35
msgid "Custom field key"
msgstr "カスタムフィールドキー"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:327
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:347
msgid "Comparison"
msgstr "比較方法"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:332
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:352
msgid "Value"
msgstr "値"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:333
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:335
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:353
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:355
msgid "Remove condition"
msgstr "条件を削除"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:342
msgid "Add condition"
msgstr "条件を追加"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:366
msgid "Number of items"
msgstr "出力件数"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:366
msgid "The maximum number of posts included each time the feed is generated."
msgstr "フィードを生成するたびに含める投稿の最大件数です。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:371
msgid "Order items by"
msgstr "項目の並び順"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:371
msgid ""
"Choose whether newly published posts or recently updated posts appear first."
msgstr ""
"新しく公開された投稿と、最近更新された投稿のどちらを先に並べるか選びます。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:373
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:533
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-schema.php:114
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-schema.php:139
msgid "Published date"
msgstr "公開日"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:374
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:534
#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-schema.php:140
msgid "Modified date"
msgstr "更新日"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:379
msgid "Cache lifetime (seconds)"
msgstr "キャッシュ有効時間（秒）"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:379
msgid ""
"How long generated output is reused before checking WordPress for changes. "
"For example, 900 seconds is 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"生成したフィードを再利用し、WordPressの変更を再確認するまでの時間です。例えば"
"900秒は15分です。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:392
msgid ""
"Choose a value source for each output field. Field-specific choices appear "
"only when they are needed."
msgstr ""
"各出力項目に使用する値を選択します。フィールド固有の選択肢は、必要な場合にだ"
"け表示されます。"

#: includes/class-atshift-feed-builder-admin.php:393
